{"words": [{"text": "قَدْ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "خَسِرَ", "translation": "incurred loss"}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "those who"}, {"text": "كَذَّبُوا۟", "translation": "denied"}, {"text": "بِلِقَآءِ", "translation": "in (the) meeting"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۖ", "translation": "(with) Allah"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰٓ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "إِذَا", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "جَآءَتْهُمُ", "translation": "came to them"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّاعَةُ", "translation": "the Hour"}, {"text": "بَغْتَةًۭ", "translation": "suddenly"}, {"text": "قَالُوا۟", "translation": "they said"}, {"text": "يَـٰحَسْرَتَنَا", "translation": "Oh! Our regret"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "over"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "فَرَّطْنَا", "translation": "we neglected"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "concerning it"}, {"text": "وَهُمْ", "translation": "while they"}, {"text": "يَحْمِلُونَ", "translation": "will bear"}, {"text": "أَوْزَارَهُمْ", "translation": "their burdens"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "on"}, {"text": "ظُهُورِهِمْ ۚ", "translation": "their backs"}, {"text": "أَلَا", "translation": "Unquestionably"}, {"text": "سَآءَ", "translation": "Evil"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "(is) what"}, {"text": "يَزِرُونَ", "translation": "they bear"}], "sahih": "Those will have lost who deny the meeting with Allāh, until when the Hour [of resurrection] comes upon them unexpectedly, they will say, \"Oh, [how great is] our regret over what we neglected concerning it [i.e., the Hour],\" while they bear their burdens [i.e., sins] on their backs. Unquestionably, evil is that which they bear."}